+   Syntax:
+
+     DEFTIMEVAR (id, name)
+
+   where ID is the enumeral value used to identify the timing
+   variable, and NAME is a character string describing its purpose.  */
+
+/* The total execution time.  */
+DEFTIMEVAR (TV_TOTAL                 , "total time")
